## ✨ Why Parse-Local?

| 🛡️ Private | 🤖 Smart | 🚀 Fast |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Runs 100% on your hardware. No cloud, no tracking. | Uses Mistral Nemo 12B to understand site context. | Optimized C++ inference with GPU support. |

