## ⚡ Quick Start

> [!IMPORTANT]
> First run triggers a **~7 GB model download**. Make sure you have a stable connection!

### 🐧 Linux & 🍎 macOS
```bash
git clone [https://github.com/oleszyk-ai/parse-local.git](https://github.com/oleszyk-ai/parse-local.git)
cd parse-local
chmod +x setup.sh && ./setup.sh
source .venv/bin/activate && python -m app.main
